    "reference.json, the reference of the reports of the versions, was taken at one process of the API, the only number then — it is its journey of make measure that is at one process (its own passes of read all, by processes, run at one, two and four, and are not what the versions are compared to): the reports of the versions (US-2300) are compared to a reference at one process, whatever the default of the service platform, which is four."
